+#### Target TGT001 ÔÇö Scope 1 and Scope 2 absolute reduction
+
+This target is an **absolute reduction** target covering **Scope 1 and Scope 2** emissions for the **whole entity**, with progress monitored using an absolute emissions metric (tCOÔéée).
