+### PCAF methodology for listed equity (plain-language description)
+
+For listed equity, financed emissions are estimated by attributing a share of an issuerÔÇÖs emissions proxy to the entity based on the entityÔÇÖs ownership exposure. The attribution factor is derived from the **market value of the holding** relative to the issuerÔÇÖs **enterprise value including cash (EVIC)**. That attribution factor is then applied to an **issuer-level proxy input**, which in this methodology is **issuer revenue**.
