+| Listed equity | 2024 | EUR | 556.40 | Issuer revenue |
+| Listed equity | 2024 | EUR | 35.36 | Issuer revenue |
+| Listed equity | 2024 | EUR | 79.11 | Issuer revenue |
+| Listed equity | 2024 | EUR | 25.57 | Issuer revenue |
