+### Climate-related targets and progress
+
+The bank uses targets to monitor progress in reducing operational emissions and financed emissions intensity, and to track progress against an all-scopes target.
+
+#### Target TGT001 ÔÇö Scope 1 and Scope 2 absolute reduction
+
+This target is an **absolute reduction** target covering **Scope 1 and Scope 2** emissions for the **whole entity**, with progress monitored using an absolute tCOÔéée metric.
+
+- **Baseline year:** 2020
+- **Baseline value:** 137,849 tCOÔéée
+- **Target:** 42% reduction
+- **Interim milestones:**
+  - 2025: 120,480 tCOÔéée
+  - 2028: 97,321.4 tCOÔéée
+- **GHG gases covered:** all Kyoto 7
+- **Third-party validation:** validated by **SBTi**
+- **2024 progress:** 40.0% progress
+- **Status:** on track
+
+#### Scope 3 Category 15 (financed emissions) ÔÇö lending intensity reduction
+
+This target covers **Scope 3 Category 15 (financed emissions)** for the **whole entity** and is expressed as an **intensity metric**: **tCOÔéée per EUR million of lending**. Progress is monitored using a tCOÔéée-per-EUR-million measure.
+
+- **Baseline year:** 2022
+- **Baseline value:** 20.0 tCOÔéée per EUR million of lending
+- **Target:** 30% reduction
+- **Interim milestones:**
+  - 2025: 18.2 tCOÔéée per EUR million of lending
+  - 2028: 15.8 tCOÔéée per EUR million of lending
+- **GHG gases covered:** all Kyoto 7
+- **Sectoral decarbonisation approach:** applied
+- **Third-party validation:** validated by **UNEP FI**
+- **2024 progress:** 25.0% progress
+
+For reference, the bankÔÇÖs financed emissions intensity metric used for monitoring is **20.0 tCOÔéée per EUR million**.
+
+#### All-scopes target (whole entity)
+
+The bank also monitors progress against an **all-scopes** target for the whole entity, with progress measured as a percentage reduction versus a baseline.
+
+- **Baseline value:** 120,000
+- **GHG gases covered:** all Kyoto 7
+- **Progress metric:** percentage reduction versus baseline
+- **2024 progress:** 13.3% progress
+- **Relationship to other targets:** associated with Target TGT001
+- **Planned use of carbon credits:** 8.2% of the target plan is linked to **technology removal** credits
+
+The bank reports a total of **21,080 tCOÔéée** of carbon credits in its carbon credit summary.
+
+### Data quality and estimation approach (financed emissions)
+
+To support decision-useful interpretation of financed emissions metrics, the bank summarises the mix of data sources and estimation approaches used in the financed emissions inventory.
